  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "參觀月世界「呂--家古厝」"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">作者：</span><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>簡櫻汝&nbsp;</b></span></p><p><br /></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">深山惡地pha荒區</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">傳統塗kat紅瓦厝</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">近兩百年平民居（ku）</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">呂--家古厝寫歷史</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">古厝起造用心思</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">風格結構真特殊</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">吸引齊柏林大師</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">「看見台灣」一明珠</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">樸實多樣磚門窗</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">七包三向西坐東</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">九十二間古味藏</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">囝孫興旺真濟房</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">刻苦耐勞作穡人</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">事事項項照起工</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">散赤子弟知輕重</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">各行各業出gâu人</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiOwoaXpDnql_YrveJzVCneI0ShAafP43TkCvms3f1JKJT45kqho-5CNdxK5qTARkB4OIOl467D87che0gp3p-xvqxOIpQp5P4gwaY-tG0l9Sl-5c2RXAfjbUJpeMzKIvZC_5kBSE0gXOPSz63Cy-RJFKOmXxf-FYYQDZ-2KfI3bv5CGFBITu38t7uAeSJO/s4000/20241218_114942.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3000\" data-original-width=\"4000\" height=\"240\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiOwoaXpDnql_YrveJzVCneI0ShAafP43TkCvms3f1JKJT45kqho-5CNdxK5qTARkB4OIOl467D87che0gp3p-xvqxOIpQp5P4gwaY-tG0l9Sl-5c2RXAfjbUJpeMzKIvZC_5kBSE0gXOPSz63Cy-RJFKOmXxf-FYYQDZ-2KfI3bv5CGFBITu38t7uAeSJO/s320/20241218_114942.jpg\" width=\"320\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiBtrk3riwXCW4jM51uB8CzKUgO5ieFsvct2Jlj8LI-IQ6eJA3PS7XaJJftnwXTMCTW-nJdaJfSnEbxhf6dIMUWkYiHor21sOL3bdaAMsUZb8CtdaJw9gwAfAqVrIeNUctD1hN6gS0eQVGycoYdU-4EdRfNDz7KoM-QVhx79H7IghGRqtfSM8783sXxa3xn/s4000/20241218_142949.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3000\" data-original-width=\"4000\" height=\"240\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiBtrk3riwXCW4jM51uB8CzKUgO5ieFsvct2Jlj8LI-IQ6eJA3PS7XaJJftnwXTMCTW-nJdaJfSnEbxhf6dIMUWkYiHor21sOL3bdaAMsUZb8CtdaJw9gwAfAqVrIeNUctD1hN6gS0eQVGycoYdU-4EdRfNDz7KoM-QVhx79H7IghGRqtfSM8783sXxa3xn/s320/20241218_142949.jpg\" width=\"320\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhIiVlB3KzCyzS4cu8MzAoOp6Zft726vUvJU1hw0y0CTj8WBnVA4DnOBBknNi_7EYMqYkDZ1B4EW5JmPsy-LCX9dWSdn8fnFM1FEQhKguoxlg85WVEjiqMrr0fuvEuC-e9EHw18p3lOIRnQCG29WsJongK1Tclw8KFk5TZt357JipWMZQ7oHaRDnby6K4Lk/s4000/20241218_145048.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3000\" data-original-width=\"4000\" height=\"240\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhIiVlB3KzCyzS4cu8MzAoOp6Zft726vUvJU1hw0y0CTj8WBnVA4DnOBBknNi_7EYMqYkDZ1B4EW5JmPsy-LCX9dWSdn8fnFM1FEQhKguoxlg85WVEjiqMrr0fuvEuC-e9EHw18p3lOIRnQCG29WsJongK1Tclw8KFk5TZt357JipWMZQ7oHaRDnby6K4Lk/s320/20241218_145048.jpg\" width=\"320\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhQgKUAxYpzKKpN1GJz_vNrbhGdxpFgPFJvAJkrGW_2wH1pOLsVbL4F_ZD1xsLXQjcYnYbwZ9e7F8HRRtKvf7Ms1pA8Ikivlep0qhrQIwrD3LZpHA_UPzGy8uBKoxuGHmepkbq6K9dKkpeguiKeSNujIe925HGenCJdQKHyUG0tgMOwi2TdIb7P_2eXkj7A/s4000/20241218_145215.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3000\" data-original-width=\"4000\" height=\"240\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhQgKUAxYpzKKpN1GJz_vNrbhGdxpFgPFJvAJkrGW_2wH1pOLsVbL4F_ZD1xsLXQjcYnYbwZ9e7F8HRRtKvf7Ms1pA8Ikivlep0qhrQIwrD3LZpHA_UPzGy8uBKoxuGHmepkbq6K9dKkpeguiKeSNujIe925HGenCJdQKHyUG0tgMOwi2TdIb7P_2eXkj7A/s320/20241218_145215.jpg\" width=\"320\" /></a></div><br /><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span><p></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">文學作家呂自揚老師，tī 2024年12月18邀請阮三个（高雄高級工業職業學校賴老師、陳--先-生kah我）做伙去田寮月世界附近ê南勢湖參觀in呂--家古厝kah伊以前ê徛家。原本烏寒ê天，早仔iáu是有淡薄仔冷，想bē到，到阮9點半約束集合進前，日頭竟然探頭--出-來--ah，真是溫暖適合行踏ê好日子！</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span></span></p><a name='more'></a><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span><p></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">呂老師是一位親切、gâu講koh tsiok有文學素養ê大作家，80歲ê伊，好記持加上難得ê文獻資料，替阮導覽、做tsiok詳細ê紹介，hōo我tsiok歡喜。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">呂老師講，古厝建材是挖附近ê塗做塗kat kih牆，下堵是khioh溪石疊--ê；用在地ê胭脂樹、龍眼樹kah刺竹做厝梁；壁是抹有tshiau稻草、牛屎ê塗漿，頂面tsiah-koh抹白石灰；鋪石頭ê巷仔長長長，看--起-來iáu真粗勇。古厝窗仔門是塗水師隨人設計無仝形體ê柴窗、磚窗，koh用雙喜字kah各種圖案等做妝thānn。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">呂--家古厝是高雄目前規模上大、風格樸實、厝身完整ê傳統人家厝，莫怪tī深山林內ê古厝，iáu ē用得siânn攝影師齊柏林ê注目。呂--家古厝是「七包三」（後落正身七間，前落門廳三間）ê大厝。古厝四邊整齊，結構完整，房間lóng總有92間，是台灣清國時代留--落-來面積上大、房間上濟ê塗kat紅瓦厝。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">年久月深、beh 200冬ê古厝，雖然有ê部份已經牆倒厝歪，有ê已經翻新，m̄-koh iáu保留當初起造ê外觀kah規模。古厝se̍h一輾，磚門窗邊--a lak石灰ê稻草壁看現現，iáu有百子千孫ê門聯、甕仔、石磨仔、磨刀石……，有幾間厝iáu有人蹛，阮行入去其中一間，有阿婆tī大灶前用柴leh hiânn燒水，伊講兩支thàng厝頂ê煙筒歹一支，換鐵筒ê hit支ē燙--人，無好用。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">燒lō ê日頭光照tī長長ê巷仔、古物、破厝……，經過呂老師一个一个說明，逐項lóng有味，逐項lóng tsiânn suí！</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">倚晝ê時，到古厝附近、呂老師以前ê徛家內面參觀兼食晝，倚近欣賞竹仔梁柱、眠床，iáu有珍貴ê古早日常用品。飯後阮iáu有去附近月世界ê「太陽谷」，uì hia遠遠看呂--家紅瓦古厝。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Tsit tsuā去呂--家古厝行踏，增加tsiok濟智識，收成滿滿。真歡喜有tsiah難得ê機緣，mā tsiok感謝呂老師ê牽成！</span></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhR2eTq57OOOe8doYMAabOmBgDLRnalcnTpd0QaJ5lWA7Mo_n3GKifIkP14UNDVfdGqd6argOTh2cL-o8sCeWBQ8XAgRyssYidfp0bgHvXvvjoPw7T1IqQZjqbLR4g3mLpPrWMwX8gmMHjI3bFTtzn-61mWsns-L1xal1umjC1jrAsXJTUbpH7C84iRCtup/s3107/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1371%E6%9C%9F_29.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3107\" data-original-width=\"2221\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhR2eTq57OOOe8doYMAabOmBgDLRnalcnTpd0QaJ5lWA7Mo_n3GKifIkP14UNDVfdGqd6argOTh2cL-o8sCeWBQ8XAgRyssYidfp0bgHvXvvjoPw7T1IqQZjqbLR4g3mLpPrWMwX8gmMHjI3bFTtzn-61mWsns-L1xal1umjC1jrAsXJTUbpH7C84iRCtup/w458-h640/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1371%E6%9C%9F_29.jpg\" width=\"458\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgHGgt__RHbZgF5U-_LhQBlwWanl-Aqt85iDa5K0FxfAJz9EijqZPATw2aXUCYORcdF1bldTmK3bbYUbIC62TnrEN1QpmtYz4KO0qk_Z1gqSY-h8ByVvaPI0xHeY8K0c-tYYnq71-IUlSSOx4EMx06FpPi6B_I5ZrNr28w30f_2h2tUxxaTF3pjQRJxWouI/s3107/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1371%E6%9C%9F_30.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3107\" data-original-width=\"2221\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgHGgt__RHbZgF5U-_LhQBlwWanl-Aqt85iDa5K0FxfAJz9EijqZPATw2aXUCYORcdF1bldTmK3bbYUbIC62TnrEN1QpmtYz4KO0qk_Z1gqSY-h8ByVvaPI0xHeY8K0c-tYYnq71-IUlSSOx4EMx06FpPi6B_I5ZrNr28w30f_2h2tUxxaTF3pjQRJxWouI/w458-h640/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1371%E6%9C%9F_30.jpg\" width=\"458\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><!--more--><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEh-oj4pjXlqh0g-wtg0GJI4ztOB4X4CvR9tds6y-BDitMOyNTDR0m7UHiCKNpwOBXlkwyBC0h8mU-Gwvhg7YCMhpV53TaRa0B1OEJpfMhWkDwBYMSSQqpybLRWBkbh-nRyCkQEV8UrjIfVYII3ZsL-fiVwRNTT8AvxvTyfpKh-hZR2sjmUfSyJxPF200lji/s1424/371%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0